From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hansen0411 <hansennguyen.ee14@nycu.edu.tw>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Build environment: SiFive GCC 10.1 multilib, Verilator
 5.040, untraced runs

- boot_rom/Makefile, sw/CMakeLists.txt, sw/cmake/riscv.cmake: pass -march/-mabi explicitly
  (riscv64-unknown-elf-gcc 10.1 multilib), drop _zicsr for GCC 10, no -flto at link.
- util/waiver-gen.py: also parse "Verilator 5.040" version strings.
- tb/tb_top.cpp: XHEEP_NO_TRACE=1 skips the FST waveform (much faster runs).
- vendored xheep_spi: lint waiver around set_dma_regs (UNUSEDSIGNAL in Verilator 5.040),
  kept for re-vendoring in hw/vendor/patches/xheep_spi (patch_dir in spi.vendor.hjson).
---
 hw/ip/boot_rom/Makefile                       |  2 +-
 ...rilator-lint-off-unused-set-dma-regs.patch | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 hw/vendor/xheep/spi.vendor.hjson              |  2 ++
 .../rtl/w25q128jw_controller.sv               |  2 ++
 sw/CMakeLists.txt                             |  8 ++++++--
 sw/cmake/riscv.cmake                          | 13 ++++++++----
 tb/tb_top.cpp                                 | 18 ++++++++++-------
 util/waiver-gen.py                            |  2 +-
 8 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 hw/vendor/patches/xheep_spi/0001-verilator-lint-off-unused-set-dma-regs.patch

diff --git a/hw/ip/boot_rom/Makefile b/hw/ip/boot_rom/Makefile
